      "importance": 72,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该事件标志着主流模型在计算机使用能力上的重要进展，对AI代理领域有潜在影响，且来自官方公告，可信度高。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "This event marks significant progress in computer use capabilities for a mainstream model, with potential impact on AI agents, and comes from an official announcement with high credibility.",
