      "titleZh": "Gemini 3.5 Flash 引入计算机使用功能",
      "titleEn": "Introducing computer use in Gemini 3.5 Flash",
      "summaryZh": "Google DeepMind 宣布在 Gemini 3.5 Flash 中引入计算机使用功能，使模型能够通过视觉理解屏幕并执行点击、输入等操作，为自动化任务提供新可能。",
      "summaryEn": "Google DeepMind announced the introduction of computer use capabilities in Gemini 3.5 Flash, enabling the model to understand screens visually and perform actions like clicking and typing, opening new possibilities for automation.",
      "keywords": [
        "Gemini 3.5 Flash",
